Model data in this directory

Brain model (brain-mesh.bin.gz + brain-mesh.json: 3D meshes; brain-2d.json + brain-2d-*.png:
2D views rendered from them) is derived data, built by tools/build_brain.py from files
distributed by TemplateFlow (https://www.templateflow.org; Ciric R, et al. Nat Methods
2022;19:1568-1571):

1. Cortex: FreeSurfer fsaverage (fsaverage6, den-41k) pial surfaces and sulcal depth
   (tpl-fsaverage). FreeSurfer is distributed under the FreeSurfer Software License
   Agreement (https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/fswiki/FreeSurferSoftwareLicense).
   Fischl B, et al. Hum Brain Mapp 1999;8:272-284.

2. Deep structures: FreeSurfer aseg segmentation of the ICBM 152 Nonlinear Asymmetrical
   template version 2009c (tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym, res-02), converted to smoothed surfaces.
   Fonov V, et al. NeuroImage 2011;54:313-327.

